IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `eca-nouns`

-- Employment Claims Act 2016 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition: THE FOUR SCHEDULES, as tables.
-- Each schedule is a table of matters (declared in eca-nouns) and this module gives the item number the Act prints against each one,
-- with the row of the Act quoted beside its entry.  Which family a dispute falls in (s 2(1)) is decided in eca-part1-preliminary.
-- The Schedules may be amended by the Minister's order (s 32(1)); these are the tables as printed in the consolidation encoded.
-- Target compiler: main (build 109).

@ref Schedule 1, items 1 to 18 (src:2142-2162)
GIVEN matter IS A `First Schedule matter`
GIVETH A STRING
`sch 1 item number of` MEANS
    CONSIDER matter
    -- src:2142 | 1. Allowance (however described in the contract of service)
    WHEN `Allowance (however described in the contract of service)` THEN "1"
    -- src:2143 | 2. Annual wage supplement
    WHEN `Annual wage supplement` THEN "2"
    -- src:2144 | 3. Bonus payment
    WHEN `Bonus payment` THEN "3"
    -- src:2145 | 4. Commission
    WHEN `Commission` THEN "4"
    -- src:2147 | 5. Deduction from salary
    WHEN `Deduction from salary` THEN "5"
    -- src:2148 | 6. Employment assistance payment
    WHEN `Employment assistance payment` THEN "6"
    -- src:2149 | 7. Incentive payment (however described in the contract of service)
    WHEN `Incentive payment (however described in the contract of service)` THEN "7"
    -- src:2150 | 8. Medical benefit
    WHEN `Medical benefit` THEN "8"
    -- src:2151 | 9. Overtime payment
    WHEN `Overtime payment` THEN "9"
    -- src:2153 | 10. Pay for extra work
    WHEN `Pay for extra work` THEN "10"
    -- src:2154 | 11. Pay for public holiday or paid leave
    WHEN `Pay for public holiday or paid leave` THEN "11"
    -- src:2155 | 12. Pay for work on public holiday
    WHEN `Pay for work on public holiday` THEN "12"
    -- src:2156 | 13. Pay for work on rest day
    WHEN `Pay for work on rest day` THEN "13"
    -- src:2158 | 14. Payment in lieu of unconsumed leave
    WHEN `Payment in lieu of unconsumed leave` THEN "14"
    -- src:2159 | 15. Reimbursement for expenses incurred while carrying out official duties
    WHEN `Reimbursement for expenses incurred while carrying out official duties` THEN "15"
    -- src:2160 | 16. Salary
    WHEN `Salary` THEN "16"
    -- src:2161 | 17. Salary in lieu of notice of termination
    WHEN `Salary in lieu of notice of termination` THEN "17"
    -- src:2162 | 18. Termination benefit (including retrenchment benefit or retirement benefit)
    WHEN `Termination benefit (including retrenchment benefit or retirement benefit)` THEN "18"

@ref Schedule 2, items 1 to 45 (src:2173-2382)
GIVEN matter IS A `Second Schedule matter`
