    -- src:2298 | (1A) and (3) of the Employment Act 1968
    WHEN `Item 26: female employee's paid maternity leave, and payment for working in the benefit period before confinement (EA 1968 s 76)` THEN "26"
    -- src:2300 | 27. Entitlement of person nominated by female employee under section 80(4) of
    -- src:2301 | the Employment Act 1968, or personal representative of female employee, to
    -- src:2302 | receive payment from the employer under section 79(1) or (2) of that Act, on
