    WHEN `Item 27: payment to the person nominated by, or the personal representative of, a female employee on her death (EA 1968 s 79 and s 80(4))` THEN "27"
    -- src:2305 | 28. Employee’s entitlement to paid childcare leave under section 87A(1) and (5)
