@ref Schedule 3, items 1 to 3 (src:2392-2413)
GIVEN matter IS A `Third Schedule matter`
GIVETH A STRING
`sch 3 item number of` MEANS
    CONSIDER matter
    -- src:2392 | 1. Any dispute, in relation to which an employee may lodge a claim mentioned
    -- src:2393 | in section 14(2) of the Employment Act 1968, over whether the employee
    -- src:2394 | has been dismissed without just cause or excuse by an employer
    -- src:2399 | THIRD SCHEDULE — continued
    WHEN `Item 1: dismissal without just cause or excuse, where the employee may claim under EA 1968 s 14(2)` THEN "1"
    -- src:2401 | 2. Any dispute, in relation to which a female employee may lodge a claim
    -- src:2402 | mentioned in section 84(2) of the Employment Act 1968, over whether a
    -- src:2403 | notice of dismissal given by an employer to the female employee in the
    -- src:2404 | circumstances mentioned in section 84(1)(a), (b) or (c) of that Act was or
    -- src:2405 | was not given for sufficient cause
    WHEN `Item 2: notice of dismissal to a female employee without sufficient cause, where she may claim under EA 1968 s 84(2)` THEN "2"
    -- src:2407 | 3. Any dispute, in relation to which a female employee mentioned in
    -- src:2408 | section 12(1) of the Child Development Co‑Savings Act 2001 may lodge
    -- src:2409 | a claim mentioned in section 84(2) of the Employment Act 1968 (as applied
    -- src:2410 | to the female employee), over whether a notice of dismissal given by an
    -- src:2411 | employer to the female employee in the circumstances mentioned in
    -- src:2412 | section 84(1)(a), (b) or (c) of the Employment Act 1968 (as applied to the
    -- src:2413 | female employee) was or was not given for sufficient cause
    WHEN `Item 3: notice of dismissal without sufficient cause to a female employee mentioned in CDCA 2001 s 12(1), who may claim under EA 1968 s 84(2) as applied` THEN "3"

@ref Schedule 4, items 1 to 3 (src:2423-2431)
GIVEN matter IS A `Fourth Schedule obligation`
GIVETH A STRING
`sch 4 item number of` MEANS
    CONSIDER matter
    -- src:2423 | 1. An employer’s obligations under sections 95, 95A and 96 of the
    -- src:2424 | Employment Act 1968
    WHEN `Item 1: an employer's obligations under EA 1968 s 95, 95A and 96` THEN "1"
    -- src:2426 | 2. An employer’s obligations under paragraph 6A of Part IV of the Fourth
    -- src:2427 | Schedule to the Employment of Foreign Manpower (Work Passes)
    -- src:2428 | Regulations 2012
    WHEN `Item 2: an employer's obligations under para 6A of Part IV of the Fourth Schedule to the Employment of Foreign Manpower (Work Passes) Regulations 2012` THEN "2"
    -- src:2430 | 3. An employer’s obligations under paragraph 5 of Part II of the Fifth Schedule
    -- src:2431 | to the Employment of Foreign Manpower (Work Passes) Regulations 2012
    WHEN `Item 3: an employer's obligations under para 5 of Part II of the Fifth Schedule to the Employment of Foreign Manpower (Work Passes) Regulations 2012` THEN "3"
